cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below. To reference a specific software version, also cite the Zenodo DOI."
type: software

title: "Basilisk and Docker for Reproducible GN&C Simulation"
abstract: >
  A Docker-based containerization workflow for the Basilisk astrodynamics
  simulation framework. Encapsulates the complete build environment,
  version-pinned dependencies, and a fixed Basilisk revision within a
  portable container image. Includes example scenarios of increasing
  complexity, from module and messaging fundamentals to spacecraft orbital
  dynamics in Earth and Sun-Earth environments.

